   "fix": "Add a public `@[simp] theorem antilinearOfOneL_apply_apply (v : V) (w : \u2102) : antilinearOfOneL V v w = starRingEnd \u2102 w \u2022 v` and derive `antilinearOfOneL_apply_I_smul` from it.",
